    "description": "Explains the lag of one Consumer Group on one Topic. It reads the lag of every queue, the Topic route and the Broker that holds the most lag, then reports a severity, likely causes and recommendations. Use it when a group is behind and you need a cause. For the raw per-queue numbers use rocketmq_get_consumer_lag.",
