      "readOnlyHint": true,
      "title": "RocketMQ consumer progress"
    },
    "description": "Returns the progress of one Consumer Group over every Topic it consumes: totals for lag and in-flight messages, and a page of per-queue rows. Use it when you know the group but not the Topic, or need the lag across all of its Topics. For one Topic use rocketmq_get_consumer_lag.",
